  "system": {
    "identifier": "hyuga-8-trigrams-grid-palm",
    "description": "<p>You slam your hand on the ground creating a network of grids along the ground that then cover all enemies inflicting great pain on them. Select a point on the space you occupy as you fill a 15-foot radius centered on this point with your special grid. All creatures of your choice, within range, must make a Charisma saving throw, becoming restrained by the intense pain they experience for the duration. Creatures restrained in this way remake their saves at the end of each of their turns.</p>\n<p>Eight Trigram. For the duration of this jutsu, creatures who fail their saving throw become unable to cast jutsu that requires hand signs of a rank equal to or lower than the rank of this jutsu.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3.</p>",
